      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H0PSp",
          "fill": "$text-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "C · Agents first, the thread second",
          "lineHeight": 1.15,
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "nEeyq",
          "name": "Parti pris",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Yt6Ms",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "PARTI PRIS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "q0fcQr",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "A room opens on its agents: one card each, with its state, what it waits on from you, its last word and what waits for it. The thread in order is one switch away. Hermes opens on the projects in the same way.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "g2Nbb",
          "name": "Solves",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "b2XfZX",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "SOLVES",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s9lx8",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Who needs you, and for what, is the first thing on the screen, on the card of the agent concerned, with the one action that unblocks it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Sso5e",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "In the by agent view, a waiting message lives on the card of the agent it waits for, and nowhere else.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "q1KINg",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Picking a card aims the composer at that agent, so the to menu and the queue hint follow what you are looking at.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kB14e",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Hermes’ briefing lands on the project it is about, with its pending write beside it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "NDUVp",
          "name": "Costs",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ifiTb",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "COSTS",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lyNFC",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The exchange between agents is no longer read in order at a glance: by agent shows only each agent’s latest exchange. Reading the conversation is the in order view, which is today’s thread.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "H8x23",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Six cards fill a 900px screen: a seventh agent scrolls the board.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "aEPYM",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Closest to the Agents page and the Dashboard: Chat risks becoming a third fleet view.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "rYKBK",
          "name": "New, to build",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "padding": [
            8,
            0,
            0,
            0
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BLQzj",
              "name": "PanelCaption",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "content": "NEW, TO BUILD",
              "lineHeight": 1.2,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.8
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sffJS",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Agent card with last word and waiting items (Panel, StatusSquare, StatusBadge, MetaChip, Button).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "R1rWbS",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Project card for Hermes, with Hermes’ note and a pending write.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
